# November 19, 2026: Albany County outside the city, a third pass: Menands (the two great cemeteries and the Albany Felt
# mill), the Town of Bethlehem (Cedar Hill and Selkirk), New Scotland (the Onesquethaw valley's church and barns),
# Guilderland Center and Guilderland, and Berne. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region albco).
# Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages and nearby lists,
# the Albany Rural Cemetery's own hours and rules pages, the Hudson River Valley National Heritage Area and Discover
# Albany listings (tools/page.py), and albanyhilltowns.com's Berne church pages (read through the web fetch tool).
